            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p><strong>For apparel using DTF transfers:</strong></p><ul><li>Wash inside out</li><li>Wait 24 hours before washing</li><li>Do NOT iron over design</li><li>Hang to dry or tumble dry low</li><li>Do NOT bleach</li><li>Do NOT dry clean</li></ul><p><strong>For items (i.e. glass cups) using UV DTF:</strong></p><p><strong>Care Instructions:</strong></p><ul><li>Hand wash only</li><li>Use warm water and soft sponge or washcloth</li><li>Avoid abrasive/harsh cleansers</li><li>Do not soak</li></ul>",
